THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Clipper includes or depends on the following third-party software:

OBS Studio / libobs
  License: GNU General Public License v2.0 or later
  Source: https://obsproject.com/
  Notes: Clipper's engine links to libobs for video recording functionality.
         The Flatpak package bundles OBS/libobs and related capture plugins.

vdf (Valve Data Format parser)
  License: MIT License
  Notes: Bundled in the Flatpak package for Steam library parsing.

Additional bundled components in the Flatpak package include x264, mbedtls,
obs-vkcapture, obs-pipewire-audio-capture, and other dependencies. Their
respective license files are installed by Flatpak Builder.
